        "    Hill height w0     = 1.0 kJ/mol (initial height for WT-MetaD).\n"
        "    Bias factor   gamma = 10 (effective sampling temperature\n"
        "                                gamma*T/(gamma-1) ~ 333 K, a standard\n"
        "                                alanine-dipeptide compromise).\n"
        "    Deposition stride  : every 500 dynamics steps  dt = 2 fs\n"
        "                          => 1 hill/ps.\n"
        "\n"
        "Boundary conditions:\n"
        "    No bias cutoff or wall is applied to (phi, psi); the periodic\n"
        "    range [-pi, pi) is tiled by 72 cells of width 5 degrees each,\n"
        "    cell-centred grid points at -pi + (i+0.5)*5 degrees\n"
        "    (i = 0..71).  The wrap-around is handled analytically inside the\n"
        "    Gaussian evaluation; no minimum-image artefacts can appear.\n"
    )


